msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「Morning.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Buenos días.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh!? Where did you come from?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Eh?! ¿De dónde saliste?」"

msgid "Taiga「What's wrong with me being here?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué tiene de malo que esté aquí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, there is one thing...... Did you＿forget what happened yesterday?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, hay un detalle...... ¿Se＿te olvidó lo que pasó ayer?」"

msgid "Taiga「You're the one who forgot.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tú eres el que lo olvidó.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Forgot what? Well, it's true I don't＿remember much these days.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Olvidé qué? Bueno, es cierto que＿no recuerdo mucho últimamente.」"

msgid "Taiga「That's not what I meant. Hmm, let's＿see. First of all, there's a saying - \"an＿army travels on its stomach.\"」"
msgstr "Taiga「No me refería a eso. Mmm, a ver.＿Primero, hay un dicho: \"no se puede＿pelear con el estómago vacío\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, so you're just hungry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, así que solo tienes hambre.」"

msgid "Taiga「Let me finish!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Déjame terminar!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「OUCH! Don't yank on my ear! What are＿you trying to do to someone with a＿kitchen knife in his hand!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡AY! ¡No me tires de la oreja! ¡¿Qué＿intentas hacerle a alguien que tiene＿un cuchillo de cocina en la mano?!」"

msgid "Taiga「I'm not scared of you and your little＿kitchen knife.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No me dan miedo ni tú ni tu＿cuchillito de cocina.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I am! It's cutlery, for Christ's sake!＿It's no joke for either of us!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Pues a mí sí! ¡Es un arma blanca,＿por Dios! ¡No es broma para ninguno＿de los dos!」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't change the subject!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡No cambies de tema!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not. Carry on.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No lo hago. Sigue.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Where was I?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿En qué estaba?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't care.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No me importa.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Forget it!」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¡Olvídalo!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't want to! Just take your coat off＿and sit down! Then we can continue＿the conversation!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No quiero! ¡Quítate el abrigo＿y siéntate! ¡Así podemos seguir＿con la conversación!」"

msgid "Taiga「What's with you!? I didn't come here to＿mooch food off you!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Qué te pasa?! ¡No vine aquí＿a sacarte comida gratis!」"

msgid "Taiga「Wha!? Yes I could!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Qué?! ¡Claro que sí!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay, well, I can't finish listening. I'm＿gonna eat.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, pues no puedo seguir＿escuchando. Voy a comer.」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Mmm, the miso soup is perfect, if I＿do say so myself. Now for the rest.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Mmm, la sopa de miso quedó＿perfecta, modestia aparte.＿Ahora lo demás.」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Taiga「Damn you......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Maldito seas......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, that reminds me. Got any plans for＿today?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, eso me recuerda. ¿Tienes＿planes para hoy?」"

msgid "Taiga「Not really.」"
msgstr "Taiga「La verdad no.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay. In that case, I'd really appreciate＿it if you'd help me look for memories＿again.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien. En ese caso, te agradecería＿mucho si me ayudaras a buscar＿mis recuerdos otra vez.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Excuse me? I ditched you yesterday＿for that reason, and now you think you＿can just ask me for help?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......¿Perdón? Ayer te dejé plantado＿por eso mismo, ¿y ahora crees que puedes＿venir a pedirme ayuda?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, I take it back. Go ahead and＿start on the food.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien, me retracto. Adelante,＿empieza a comer.」"

msgid "Taiga「Why?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Por qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Think of it as an advance thank-you＿gift for helping out.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Considéralo un agradecimiento＿por adelantado por ayudarme.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah, that was the arrangement,＿wasn't it? That does sound familiar.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí, ese era el trato, ¿verdad?＿Eso sí me suena familiar.」"

msgid "Taiga「......For that matter, you've been acting＿oddly calm, haven't you?」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Hablando de eso, has estado＿actuando extrañamente tranquilo, ¿no?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What are you talking about?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿De qué estás hablando?」"

msgid "Taiga「I mean you're being all understanding＿of me...... Oh, I know, does this come＿naturally to you, too?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Digo, estás siendo muy comprensivo＿conmigo...... Ah, ya sé, ¿esto también＿te sale así de natural?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not really sure, but it feels normal＿to me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No estoy muy seguro, pero para＿mí se siente normal.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Forget it. Thanks for the food.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Olvídalo. Gracias por la comida.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, eat up.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, provecho.」"

msgid "Taiga「Okay, what is it? Have you decided on＿something in particular to do?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bien, ¿qué pasa? ¿Ya decidiste＿hacer algo en particular?」"

msgid "Taiga「Good point...... Anyway, wanna head out＿around noon?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Buen punto...... En fin, ¿quieres＿salir cerca del mediodía?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And go where?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿E ir adónde?」"

msgid "Taiga「Where......? Is there anywhere you've＿been wanting to go?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Adónde......? ¿Hay algún lugar＿al que hayas querido ir?」"

msgid "Taiga「Alright. Then I'll come back at noon.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bien. Entonces vuelvo al mediodía.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What, you're going home?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué, te vas a tu casa?」"

msgid "Taiga「I can't spend all my time on you. I have＿things to do, you know.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No puedo pasar todo el tiempo contigo.＿Tengo cosas que hacer, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuujiiii!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ryuuujiiii!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh? Back so soon?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Ya volviste tan pronto?」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, Ryuuji, RYUUJIIII～!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ryuuji, Ryuuji, RYUUJIIII～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-W-What's wrong? What's the＿matter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Q-Qué ocurre? ¿Cuál es el problema?」"

msgid "Taiga「L-Look!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡M-Mira!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, New Year's cards. What about 'em?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, tarjetas de Año Nuevo.＿¿Qué pasa con ellas?」"

msgid "Taiga「T-There's just so many! What do I do?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡S-Son demasiadas! ¿Qué hago?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What should you do......? Well, what do＿you WANT to do?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué deberías hacer......? Bueno,＿¿qué QUIERES hacer?」"

msgid "Taiga「R-Reply to them! Can I reply to them＿now?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡R-Responderlas! ¿Puedo＿responderlas ahora?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's totally okay...... Wait, did you only＿just notice them?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro que sí...... Espera, ¿apenas＿te diste cuenta de ellas?」"

msgid "Taiga「I accidentally forgot to check the＿mailbox yesterday...... but I never would＿have thought I'd get this many.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sin querer olvidé revisar el buzón＿ayer...... pero jamás habría pensado＿que recibiría tantas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Wait, \"this many\"......? That's like, 10 at＿most.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Espera, ¿\"tantas\"......? Si acaso＿son unas 10 como mucho.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......First of all, you can discard the ones＿you already sent cards to.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Primero, puedes apartar＿las tarjetas de quienes ya＿recibieron una tuya.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ummm...... Here it is!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ehhh...... ¡Aquí está!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, just one!? It's Kushieda, to boot.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Ah, solo una?! Y encima＿es de Kushieda.」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, I didn't think anyone else would＿send one......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, no pensé que nadie más＿me enviaría una......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I gotta say, this is a very＿Kushieda-like New Year's card.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Debo decir que es una tarjeta de＿Año Nuevo muy al estilo Kushieda.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yup, hers was over-the-top last year＿too. That's my Minorin.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sip, la suya del año pasado también＿fue exagerada. Así es mi Minorin.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Look, you got one from Kawashima＿too.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Mira, también recibiste＿una de Kawashima.」"

msgid "Taiga「From StuChi? No way!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿De StuChi? ¡No puede ser!」"

msgid "Taiga「Really?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿En serio?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I think so, at least...... Oh, you got one＿from Kitamura, too. Good for you,＿Taiga.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso creo, al menos...... Ah,＿también tienes una de Kitamura.＿Qué bien, Taiga.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, you're right.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, tienes razón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What's the matter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Taiga「What do you mean?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿A qué te refieres?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, how do I put this......? I thought＿you'd be a little happier about it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, ¿cómo decirlo......? Pensé que＿te pondrías un poco más contenta.」"

msgid "Taiga「What, shall I dance a jig for you?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué, quieres que te baile una giga?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's not what I'm saying. Well, what＿the hell is a \"jig\" in the first place?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No digo eso. Bueno, ¿y qué diablos＿es una \"giga\" para empezar?」"

msgid "Taiga「Not something I made up, that's for＿sure...... Oh, I got one from that stupid＿hippie.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No es algo que inventé yo, eso＿seguro...... Ah, me llegó una＿de ese hippie estúpido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Please call him Haruta. At least in＿your New Year's greeting.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Por favor, llámalo Haruta. Al＿menos en tu saludo de Año Nuevo.」"

msgid "Taiga「All that's left...... This one's from that＿first-year who was on the ChrisPar＿committee with us, as I recall.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Solo queda esta...... Creo que es de＿ese estudiante de primer año que estuvo＿en el comité de la FiesNavi.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhhh...... Sorry, I can't really remember.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehhh...... Perdón, no logro recordarlo.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, sorry.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, perdón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's fine. By \"ChrisPar\" do you mean＿Christmas party?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No pasa nada. ¿Con \"FiesNavi\" te＿refieres a la fiesta de Navidad?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yup. It was hosted by the student＿council. You were in the organization＿committee, along with me and StuChi.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sip. La organizó el consejo estudiantil.＿Tú estabas en el comité organizador,＿con StuChi y conmigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now that you mention it...... So you gave＿that first-year your address?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahora que lo mencionas...... ¿Entonces＿le diste tu dirección?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, come to think of it, I did. Didn't＿you get one too?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, pensándolo bien, lo hice. ¿A＿ti no te llegó una también?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, actually, I have yet to go and＿check.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, la verdad, todavía＿no he ido a revisar.」"

msgid "Taiga「Excuse me? How dare you look down＿on other people's kindness!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Perdón? ¡Cómo te atreves a menospreciar＿la amabilidad ajena!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not looking down on them! I just＿haven't checked!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No la estoy menospreciando!＿¡Solo no he revisado!」"

msgid "Taiga「What do you mean?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué quieres decir?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Oh fine I forgive you so help me with＿my New Year's greetings okay let's get＿started.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Ah bueno te perdono así que＿ayúdame con mis tarjetas de Año Nuevo＿sí empecemos de una vez.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Ohh? You said all that in one breath.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿E-Ehh? Dijiste todo eso＿de un solo respiro.」"

msgid "Taiga「Shut up. We don't have much time to＿reply.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Cállate. No tenemos mucho＿tiempo para responder.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But help you how......? Want me to＿prepare the envelopes?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Pero ayudarte cómo......? ¿Quieres＿que prepare los sobres?」"

msgid "Taiga「I should probably do that, so you＿can...... make some potato stamps, I＿guess?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Debería hacerlo yo, así que＿tú puedes...... hacer unos sellos＿de papa, ¿supongo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Make...... potato stamps?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Hacer...... sellos de papa?」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, i-is that too old-fashioned after all?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, ¿e-es demasiado anticuado＿después de todo?」"

msgid "Taiga「I thought so. Plus, you seem like you'd＿be good at it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eso pensé. Además, tienes pinta＿de que se te daría bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Sheesh. Once these are done, I'm＿counting on you to help me with mine.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Caramba. Cuando terminemos estas,＿cuento contigo para las mías.」"

msgid "Taiga「It's a deal. Come on, I'm gonna start＿tidying up.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Trato hecho. Anda, voy a＿empezar a ordenar esto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......How's it going? Almost done?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Cómo vas? ¿Ya casi terminas?」"

msgid "Taiga「Annnnd...... There. Done!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Yyy...... Listo. ¡Terminé!」"

msgid "Taiga「What do you think?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué te parece?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, excellent, excellent!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Oh, excelente, excelente!」"

msgid "Taiga「Your potato stamps are excellent too.＿What's with this cow? It's so good it's＿hilarious! Like a baby shower gift!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Tus sellos de papa también quedaron＿geniales. ¿Y esta vaca? ¡Es tan buena＿que da risa! ¡Parece regalo para bebé!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah, I've outdone myself.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oh sí, me superé a mí mismo.」"

msgid "Taiga「That one...... Wait, what's that list?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Esa...... Espera, ¿qué es esa lista?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It was in the desk drawer. Seems like＿it's a list of everyone we sent a card to.＿It's dated December 20th.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Estaba en el cajón. Parece ser una＿lista de todos a quienes enviamos＿tarjeta. Es del 20 de diciembre.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, that's thorough...... You＿probably got blisters from writing all＿that. That must have been really dull.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji, qué meticuloso...... Seguro＿te salieron ampollas de tanto escribir.＿Debió de ser muy aburrido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is that supposed to be a compliment?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Se supone que eso es un cumplido?」"

msgid "Taiga「Well? Are you done sorting them?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Y bien? ¿Ya terminaste de separarlas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ignored...... Well, these are the ones I＿need to reply to, and those are the＿ones I already sent cards to.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Me ignoró...... Bueno, estas son las＿que debo responder, y esas son de gente＿a la que ya le envié tarjeta.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Hmmm, I see...... The ones you don't＿recognize are practically all from our＿class.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Mmm, ya veo...... Las que＿no reconoces son prácticamente＿todas de nuestra clase.」"

msgid "Taiga「So the ones you need to reply to......＿They're all from other ChrisPar＿committee members...... Ah!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Así que las que debes responder......＿Son todas de otros miembros del comité＿de la FiesNavi...... ¡Ah!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「Did you actually read these?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿De verdad leíste estas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, not yet.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, todavía no.」"

msgid "Taiga「This is...... from Murase, who was in the＿committee and student council...... Hey,＿you can't just skim through these.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Esta es...... de Murase, del comité＿y del consejo estudiantil...... Oye,＿no puedes leerlas por encima.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hey, can you remember anything?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye, ¿logras recordar algo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hmmm...... It's no use...... Actually......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mmm...... No hay caso......＿De hecho......」"

msgid "Taiga「What?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, how do I put this...... I feel, like,＿strangely uneasy......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, ¿cómo decirlo......? Me siento＿extrañamente intranquilo......」"

msgid "Taiga「Uneasy?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Intranquilo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey, Taiga...... Honestly, I have a bad＿feeling about this.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, Taiga...... Sinceramente, tengo＿un mal presentimiento sobre esto.」"

msgid "Taiga「......I see.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Ya veo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I'll just write the reply for now. Look,＿it says \"contact me if you need them＿right away\"! Seems I don't need to rush.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「P-Por ahora solo responderé. ¡Mira, dice＿\"avísame si los necesitas de inmediato\"!＿Parece que no hay prisa.」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What's wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Qué ocurre?」"

msgid "Taiga「No, it's nothing. Can you hurry up and＿write your replies?」"
msgstr "Taiga「No, no es nada. ¿Puedes apurarte＿a escribir tus respuestas?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, uh, right. I'm nearly done, so just＿hang on, please.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, eh, claro. Ya casi termino, así＿que espera un momento, por favor.」"

msgid "Taiga「Hey Ryuuji, can I take a look at this＿New Year's card?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oye, Ryuuji, ¿puedo echarle un vistazo＿a esta tarjeta de Año Nuevo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sure, but you realize these are all the＿same as yours, right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro, pero sabes que todas estas son＿iguales a las tuyas, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Taiga「That's fine.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No importa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Can't say I'm surprised.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No puedo decir que me sorprenda.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Hmmm, that's my Minorin! She made＿sure to write something different in＿yours.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Mmm, ¡así es mi Minorin!＿Se aseguró de escribir algo＿distinto en la tuya.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh yeah? That's our girl.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ah, sí? Qué detallazo el suyo.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Yup, that's just like her...... Yup.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Sip, muy propio de ella...... Sip.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What's wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Taiga「Nothing......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Nada......」"

msgid "Taiga「I know! After we finish sending out＿these New Year's greetings, wanna＿swing by Minorin's diner for lunch?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ya sé! Cuando terminemos de enviar＿estas tarjetas, ¿vamos a almorzar＿al restaurante de Minorin?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sure, let's do that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Claro, hagamos eso.」"

msgid "Taiga「As for Yacchan...... Should we wake＿her?」"
msgstr "Taiga「En cuanto a Yacchan......＿¿Deberíamos despertarla?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, let's go. Hurry and get ready.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, vamos. Date prisa y prepárate.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What the hell was that about......?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué diablos fue eso......?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I know. But humans can't think＿straight on an empty stomach. You＿can't even finish your story right now.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, lo sé. Pero nadie puede pensar con＿claridad con el estómago vacío. Ni＿siquiera puedes terminar tu historia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So let's just eat first.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que comamos primero.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What's wrong? Go ahead and＿continue talking about whatever＿brought you here first thing in the」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Qué pasa? Sigue hablando de lo＿que te trajo aquí a primera hora de la」"

msgid "Ryuuji「morning.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「mañana.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Now that I think about it,＿something's not right here. I'm paying＿you for this food, so I should have a」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Ahora que lo pienso, algo＿no cuadra. Pago por esta comida,＿así que debería tener」"

msgid "Taiga「right to start on it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「derecho a empezar a comer.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not sure of what I should be doing＿in the first place...... I have a faint idea,＿but I can't be sure. Actually, I'd」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Para empezar, no sé qué debería＿hacer...... Tengo una vaga idea, pero＿no estoy seguro. De hecho, te」"

msgid "Ryuuji「appreciate your advice.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「agradecería tu consejo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Just hanging around somewhere＿should be fine. I might be able to＿remember where my old stomping」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Con pasar el rato por ahí＿bastará. Quizá así logre recordar＿cuál era mi zona」"

msgid "Ryuuji「ground is.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「de siempre.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......W-Well, it feels half-assed like it was＿made on a computer, but it's decent＿for a New Year's greeting. She's a」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......B-Bueno, parece hecha a medias＿en computadora, pero está decente para＿ser de Año Nuevo. Es una」"

msgid "Ryuuji「classmate, after all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「compañera de clase, después de todo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, you see, I don't really remember＿anyone, so I was hoping I could ask you＿to help me. I mean, I didn't have time」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, verás, no recuerdo a nadie,＿así que esperaba pedirte ayuda.＿Digo, no tuve tiempo」"

msgid "Ryuuji「yesterday...... It's true!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「ayer...... ¡Es verdad!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh, well, at this point we could＿probably get them done faster that＿way than if we used a computer. And it」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ehm, bueno, a estas alturas seguro＿terminamos más rápido así que usando＿la computadora. Además,」"

msgid "Ryuuji「might make a statement.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「tendría su propio estilo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......\"Present in your suit\"......? Umm, this＿Murase person says they have my suit＿and a present...... What are they talking」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿\"Regalo en tu traje\"......? Ehm,＿un tal Murase dice que tiene mi traje＿y un regalo...... ¿De qué está」"

msgid "Ryuuji「about?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「hablando?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Wow, StuChi really did make all of＿hers on a computer. It's exactly the＿same as mine. Not even slightly」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Vaya, StuChi sí hizo todas＿las suyas en computadora. Es idéntica＿a la mía. Nada」"

msgid "Taiga「artistic.」"
msgstr "Taiga「artística.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hmmm, there's leftovers for her, so we＿don't need to worry about her food,＿and I'd rather not wake her...... Annnd」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mmm, sobró comida para ella, así que＿no hay que preocuparse por eso, y＿prefiero no despertarla...... Yyy」"

msgid "Ryuuji「done. Shall we head out?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「listo. ¿Nos vamos?」"
